<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Un regalo para ti 🌸</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #fce4ec;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    }
    .bouquet {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 70px;
      animation: bloom 2s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #ad1457;
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    p {
      color: #880e4f;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    @keyframes bloom {
      0% { transform: scale(1) rotate(-2deg); }
      100% { transform: scale(1.08) rotate(2deg); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="bouquet">💐</div>
  <h1>¡Flores para ti! 🌸✨</h1>
  <p>Creado con código especialmente para sacarte una sonrisa.</p>
</body>
</html>
